        "original_id": "404e385f-4901-5b87-96b8-d03b08009c01",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dan Balan, T.I., Rihanna\n- Songs: \"Live Your Life\"\n- Albums: Paper Trail\n- Topics: Grammy nominations, songwriting credits\n\nFacts:\n- In 2008, \"Live Your Life\" was released as a song by American rapper T.I. on his sixth studio album, Paper Trail, and it features Barbadian singer Rihanna.\n- Dan Balan was nominated for a Grammy as a co-writer of \"Live Your Life,\" making him the first and only Moldovan musician to receive a Grammy nomination.",
